{"id":"rdb-8ecac5","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-0091d2d6-d61e-4a8c-956e-c33425124727","text":"## Implementation complete\n\n### Changes\n\n**New file: `engine/fuzz_test.go`** (`package engine` — needed because target functions are unexported)\n\n11 fuzz targets covering all three areas from the issue description:\n\n**SQL bind path:**\n- `FuzzSqlLiteral` — arbitrary strings through `sqlLiteral()`, verifies output is well-formed\n- `FuzzBindNoPanic` — arbitrary statement/arg combinations, verifies no panics\n\n**Row encoding/decoding round-trips:**\n- `FuzzRowRoundTripInt64` — int64 encode/decode identity\n- `FuzzRowRoundTripUint64` — uint64 encode/decode identity\n- `FuzzRowRoundTripFloat64` — float64 encode/decode identity (skips NaN/Inf)\n- `FuzzRowRoundTripString` — varchar encode/decode identity\n- `FuzzRowRoundTripBlob` — blob encode/decode identity\n\n**Schema and key encoding:**\n- `FuzzSchemaRoundTrip` — schema + checks encode/decode identity\n- `FuzzEncodeKey` — int64 key determinism\n- `FuzzEncodeKeyString` — string key determinism\n- `FuzzEncodeKeyDistinct` — distinct int64 values produce distinct keys\n\n### Seed corpus\n\nCovers known edge cases: backslashes, single quotes, null bytes, unicode, JSON payloads, empty strings, max/min int boundaries, float edge cases.\n\n### Verification\n\n- All 11 targets pass seed corpus: `go test ./engine/ -run Fuzz`\n- Tested in actual fuzz mode: `FuzzSqlLiteral` and `FuzzRowRoundTripString` ran 23k+ executions with no failures\n- Full suite: `go test ./...` — all packages green"},"created_at":"2026-09-14T12:05:57.055216Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.270 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
