{"id":"rdb-d6a593","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-876ae462-34fd-4bb0-a28a-5077f48a68a6","text":"Implementation complete. All tests pass (full suite, zero regressions).\n\n**Changes:**\n\n`engine/catalog.go`:\n- Added `Precision` field to `columnDisk` (omitempty for backward compat)\n- `encodeSchema()` now extracts precision from `sql.DatetimeType`\n- `decodeSchema()` passes precision to `decodeType()`\n- `decodeType()` handles `Type_DATE`, `Type_DATETIME`, `Type_TIMESTAMP` via `CreateDatetimeType()` and `Type_TIME` via `types.Time`\n- `validateSchema()` passes precision to `decodeType()`\n- `rawValue()` serializes `time.Time` as RFC3339Nano and `Timespan` as int64 string\n- `decodeRow()` deserializes temporal types back to `time.Time` / `Timespan`\n\n`engine/engine.go`:\n- `sqlLiteral()` handles `time.Time` parameter binding\n\n`engine/engine_test.go`:\n- Updated 2 existing unsupported-type tests (DATE → YEAR)\n- Added 13 new tests: DDL, precision, round-trip (DATE/DATETIME/TIMESTAMP/TIME), ordering, parameter binding, nullable, primary key, persistence (journal + native-git), defaults\n\nNo decisions diverged from the spec."},"created_at":"2026-09-14T12:40:55.316147Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.270 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
