{"id":"rdb-7094b9","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"CLI commit and diff commands","description":"Implement the remaining M5 CLI commands:\n\n- `repodb commit` — checkpoint accumulated journal changes into Git history\n- `repodb diff` — show pending changes (uncommitted journal entries) or differences between snapshots\n\nThese are the last missing pieces of the M5 milestone.","status":"BACKLOG","estimate":3,"sort_order":"aD","labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-09-16T20:27:16.259648Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.273 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"rdb-a2d28e","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"AUTO_INCREMENT column support","description":"Add support for `AUTO_INCREMENT` on integer primary key columns. Needs:\n\n- DDL parsing and catalog storage of the auto-increment flag\n- Sequence tracking (next value) durable across restarts and checkpoints\n- `INSERT` without an explicit key value allocates the next sequence value\n- Behavior under sync/merge (sequence convergence or conflict)","status":"BACKLOG","estimate":5,"sort_order":"aE","labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-09-16T20:27:20.84933Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.273 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"rdb-48af2f","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Foreign key constraints","description":"Add support for `FOREIGN KEY` constraints:\n\n- DDL parsing for `REFERENCES` clauses (inline and table-level)\n- Referential integrity enforcement on INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE\n- CASCADE, SET NULL, RESTRICT, and NO ACTION actions\n- Interaction with sync/merge (cross-table consistency after three-way merge)\n- `ALTER TABLE ADD/DROP FOREIGN KEY`","status":"BACKLOG","estimate":8,"sort_order":"aF","labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-09-16T20:27:22.715824Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.273 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"rdb-7094b9","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"title":"Document CLI commands in README","description":"All 11 CLI commands are already implemented. Rescoped from building `commit`/`diff` to documenting the full CLI in the README.\n\nCommands to document: `init`, `status`, `diff`, `commit`, `import-legacy`, `enable`, `sync`, `conflicts`, `resolve`, `start`, `sql`.\n\nAlso update the roadmap to mark M5 as fully complete.","status":"PLANNED","estimate":2,"sort_order":"a0","assignee":"Claude Code \u003cagent@macbook.local\u003e","dependencies":null,"labels":["task"]},"created_at":"2026-09-17T10:10:25.258329Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.273 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
