{"id":"rdb-7e4778","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Update README for remote default and dirty-journal prompt","description":"The last two commits introduced behavior that the README should reflect:\n\n1. **rdb-bc2820** — `--remote` now defaults to `repodb.remote` saved by `enable`. The `conflicts` and `resolve` examples still pass `--remote origin` unnecessarily, and the CLI table descriptions don't mention the default.\n\n2. **rdb-3c8ef9** — `repodb sync` prompts to checkpoint when the journal has uncommitted changes (interactive terminals only).\n\nUpdate the \"Synchronize an existing project\" section, CLI table, and any related prose.","status":"PLANNED","estimate":1,"sort_order":"a0","labels":["task"]},"created_at":"2026-09-17T16:23:22.295692Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.274 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
