{"id":"rdb-d3c729","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-81fb1171-1b9f-4977-b0ad-d5e03013037b","text":"Implemented per spec.\n\n- go.mod: `go 1.25.0`, x/sys v0.47.0, x/term v0.45.0 (go.sum updated). `go mod tidy -diff` is clean.\n- README: \"Go 1.25 or newer\".\n- `make test` (incl. GOOS=windows build + vet) and `go vet ./...` pass.\n\nScope note: the stale \"requires POSIX file locking\" wording (README + docs/storage-format.md) was split out to rdb-d86f52 rather than fixed here."},"created_at":"2026-09-28T08:54:56.732193Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.283 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
